{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15478","headline":"得山中道友书寄苗銭二员外 · 李端","name":"得山中道友书寄苗銭二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有谋皆轗轲，非病亦迟回。\n壮志年年减，驰晖日日催。\n还山不及伴，到阙又无媒。\n高卧成长策，微官称下才。\n诗人识何谢，居士别宗雷。\n迹向尘中隐，书从谷口来。\n药栏遭鹿践，涧户被猿开。\n野鹤巢云窦，游龟上水苔。\n新欢追易失，故思渺难裁。\n自有归期在，劳君示劫灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}